01:25:47.656 --> 01:25:48.735
- Yeah, 'cause I remember

01:25:48.735 --> 01:25:51.825
beating "Mega Man 2"
lots of times as a kid.

01:25:51.825 --> 01:25:54.325
And then I recently played
it a couple of years ago,

01:25:54.325 --> 01:25:56.605
I could barely get past fucking Woodman.

01:25:56.605 --> 01:25:58.579
And I'm like, "How the fuck did
I do this as a 10-year-old?"

01:25:58.579 --> 01:26:01.819
Oh, it's because I literally
spent like a month of my life

01:26:01.819 --> 01:26:03.336
just grinding this game.

01:26:03.336 --> 01:26:04.236
