01:26:04.236 --> 01:26:05.365
I'm gonna get fucking carpal tunnel.

01:26:05.365 --> 01:26:06.198
(Joey laughs)

01:26:06.198 --> 01:26:07.562
I tried playing "Mega Man X,"

01:26:07.562 --> 01:26:09.577
